        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "## Language and repeated audio\nConfirm the requested language and any permitted switching before recording a language mismatch. A familiar accent or an ordinary loanword is not automatically a defect.\n\nWhen a phrase repeats, record where it occurs. If feasible, compare the downloaded file with player output. Do not call it a confirmed generation defect until the available evidence distinguishes generation from playback."
      },
